data: {"t":"narration","text":"The contract recovered the signer 0x27D2...B103, found the hash in the log for job-203, read the payee from the signed intent and found it off the allowlist. 200 yuan left the vendor bond, all of it to the treasury. The payment was blocked, so nobody lost money, and paying whoever reported it would let a party stage a fake scam for the penalty. The pilot bond is untouched at 500 yuan. No bounty on a live job. Bounties exist only for registered hunters on shadow jobs, so whoever compromised a live wallet can never be paid for it.","at":1792501329076}

